        "edit": "Fix the two malformed binary literals in the case statement: 3'b100 was 8'b0001_000 (7 bits) and is corrected to 8'b0001_0000; 3'b111 was 8'b100_0000 (7 bits) and is corrected to 8'b1000_0000.",
